  "HOST|Does that work?", "EXP|In the short term, it can protect jobs. But tariffs are effectively a tax on consumers, because customs duty raises prices.",
  "HOST|What about countries with a big trade surplus?", "EXP|They are often accused of unfair practices, which can trigger trade wars.",
  "EXP|Geopolitics plays a role too. Sanctions and embargoes are now used regularly as political tools, especially on commodities like oil and gas.",
